  <Disclosure
    id="the-fix"
    title="How the fix works"
    note="the hotfix rebinds rng_get to the STM32 peripheral; libngu's guard is unchanged"
  >
    <div class="rung-html">
      <p>The hotfix works at the link and build layer, and leaves the
